# {{ project_name }}

A governed agent project scaffolded with [covenant-cli](https://github.com/AlexSalsworthy/covenant-cli).

## Setup

```bash
pip install -e .
cp .env.example .env
# Add your API keys to .env
```

## Running

```python
python src/main.py
```

## Project Structure

```
{{ project_name }}/
├── GOVERNANCE.md              # 15 governance rules -- read this first
├── registry/agents.json       # Service and agent registry
├── memory/
│   ├── inheritance/           # Exit reports from prior runs
│   └── memos/                 # Cross-service communication
├── services/                  # Governed services (add with: covenant add-service)
└── src/main.py                # Entry point
```

## Adding Services

```bash
covenant add-service my-service
```

## Governance

Read `GOVERNANCE.md` for the 15 rules that govern this project.
Every service writes exit reports. Every agent has typed I/O.
Memory is inherited, not lost.
